    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1622\"><em data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1622\">3rd Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1656\"><em data-start=\"1624\" data-end=\"1656\">Names matter. You remove them.</em></p><p data-start=\"1658\" data-end=\"1678\">Once per Soma Break:</p><p data-start=\"1680\" data-end=\"1737\">Choose a creature or effect and strip one semantic label:</p><ul data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1807\"><li data-start=\"1739\" data-end=\"1749\"><p data-start=\"1741\" data-end=\"1749\">Undead</p></li><li data-start=\"1750\" data-end=\"1762\"><p data-start=\"1752\" data-end=\"1762\">Summoned</p></li><li data-start=\"1763\" data-end=\"1774\"><p data-start=\"1765\" data-end=\"1774\">Magical</p></li><li data-start=\"1775\" data-end=\"1786\"><p data-start=\"1777\" data-end=\"1786\">Hostile</p></li><li data-start=\"1787\" data-end=\"1800\"><p data-start=\"1789\" data-end=\"1800\">Protected</p></li><li data-start=\"1801\" data-end=\"1807\"><p data-start=\"1803\" data-end=\"1807\">Etc.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1809\" data-end=\"1865\">For a short duration, abilities that rely on that label:</p><ul data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1940\"><li data-start=\"1867\" data-end=\"1875\"><p data-start=\"1869\" data-end=\"1875\">Fail</p></li><li data-start=\"1876\" data-end=\"1907\"><p data-start=\"1878\" data-end=\"1907\">Treat the target as invalid</p></li><li data-start=\"1908\" data-end=\"1940\"><p data-start=\"1910\" data-end=\"1940\">Lose their trigger condition</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1942\" data-end=\"1961\">This is loud magic.</p><p data-start=\"1963\" data-end=\"1987\">the misfire ladder applies at full weight.</p><p data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2018\">You did not change the thing.</p><p data-start=\"2020\" data-end=\"2050\">You changed what it counts as.</p><p data-start=\"2052\" data-end=\"2089\"></p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
